{"_id":"69ddf07abeb69f3ee5fa642e","title":"RoMidi - Auto Piano, Auto Drum, Auto Guitar (Midi Player)","game":{"_id":"6959526c0597a5542a8de666","gameId":0,"name":"Script hub","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/91b390adc52e6b8e66da0a4746f17a8b600288f8548efdcdc1499147899ac846.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/-1-1778292735246.jpg"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/91b390adc52e6b8e66da0a4746f17a8b600288f8548efdcdc1499147899ac846.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/-1-1778292735246.jpg"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-RoMidi-a-Roblox-Auto-Piano-and-Drum-Script-201246","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":10742,"executes":20499,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/df61dfc8d120b646860fc2cfb4c2d3990fea721b5a2010532e6ec23778a2b6d8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/-1-1778292735246.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/-1-1778292735246.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/df61dfc8d120b646860fc2cfb4c2d3990fea721b5a2010532e6ec23778a2b6d8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/-1-1778292735246.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/-1-1778292735246.jpg"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-04-14T07:44:58.384Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-14T07:44:58.384Z","lastBump":"2026-04-14T07:44:58.384Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/wownskdo/c5e1091bbaf534da3f4da608af00a98d/raw/RoMidiYessirAp\"))()","features":"RoMidi: Your All-in-One Roblox Auto-Player\nRoMidi is a script I built to make playing music on Roblox actually feel like a performance. Whether you're a pianist, guitarist, or drummer, it's designed to handle the technical side so you can just enjoy the music.\nThe Highlights:\nFull 88-Key Range: Toggle this in settings to play anything from basic tunes to full-scale classical pieces without missing a single note.\nGuitar Mode: Built specifically for Roblox guitar games. RoMidi maps your MIDI file to a real 6-string fretboard layout — High E, B, G, D, A, and Low E — and automatically handles note wrapping, stuck key prevention, and rapid retriggers so every note lands clean.\nDrum Mode: Feeling the rhythm? Switch to Drum Mode, set up specifically for Roblox drum games so it only kicks in when you're actually behind a kit.\nIt Sounds Real: I hate that robotic MIDI sound. RoMidi uses a humanization system that adds tiny timing variations and imperfections so it sounds like a real person is playing.\nNo MIDI? No Problem: There's a huge library of preset songs already loaded up — piano, guitar, drums — so you can start playing the second you run the script.\nPlay Your Own Music:\nIf you have a specific song you want to hear, you can upload your own MIDI files or use a local MIDI file:\n\nQuick Uploader: https://pandahub-romidi.vercel.app/uploader.html\nLocal MIDI Guide: https://pandahub-romidi.vercel.app/midi.html\n\nHow to use it:\nFor the full breakdown of features or help getting started, check the docs:\nhttps://pandahub-romidi.vercel.app/script.html\nWhether you're shredding a guitar riff, laying down a drum beat, or just vibing in a lobby, I hope RoMidi makes it a lot more fun. Enjoy!","tags":["RoMidi","Auto Drum","Auto Piano","Key","Auto Guitar"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/fEhAwpu7YA","keyLink":"https://pandahub-romidi.vercel.app/key.html","owner":{"_id":"660a19dab013a9ec48c7b2d0","username":"Panda_Hub","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/254cb67c8d1323fd47aa06729055a836cbbc4d26679f81b644432aa2eea9ad61.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660a19dab013a9ec48c7b2d0-1776153844957.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"660a19dab013a9ec48c7b2d0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/254cb67c8d1323fd47aa0