folder, make another folder. The name of this folder is what you will see in RoMidi.\n​If you name the subfolder \"Bruno Mars,\" then \"Bruno Mars\" will show up in the RoMidi \"Local Files\" dropdown menu.\n​You can name this subfolder anything you want to make a new category!\n\n​3. The Files\n​Put your music files inside that subfolder.\n\n​Visual Example:\nworkspace ➔ Piano Files ➔ Bruno Mars ➔ (Put your files here)\n\n​Now, when you open the Local dropdown in RoMidi, you’ll see \"Bruno Mars\" or (name of your choise) as a category. Just click it to find your songs!","parent":{"_id":"69df2deb2b2a3f1623d067e1","commentBy":{"_id":"69cf62eaf06611de61f8968a","username":"yunahin70","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"69cf62eaf06611de61f8968a"},"text":"Bro please"},"edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-16T13:12:20.351Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"69e0e077e7657415614efc07","commentBy":{"_id":"660a19dab013a9ec48c7b2d0","username":"Panda_Hub","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/254cb67c8d1323fd47aa06729055a836cbbc4d26679f81b644432aa2eea9ad61.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660a19dab013a9ec48c7b2d0-1776153844957.jpg"},"createdAt":"2024-04-01T02:20:10.972Z","lastActive":"2026-05-31T15:31:02.951Z","status":"offline","id":"660a19dab013a9ec48c7b2d0","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/254cb67c8d1323fd47aa06729055a836cbbc4d26679f81b644432aa2eea9ad61.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660a19dab013a9ec48c7b2d0-1776153844957.jpg"}},"text":"@yunahin70 read the description bro there's a link for local midi files tutorial","parent":{"_id":"69df1c99d09e64d46851a869","commentBy":{"_id":"69cf62eaf06611de61f8968a","username":"yunahin70","profilePicture":"/images/user-default.webp","status":"offline","id":"69cf62eaf06611de61f8968a"},"text":"Is the drum script working"